      "flavor": "Filed from a barrel collar that burst its own liner, re-bored, and notched with a detent for every lane the gunner works. The thumb finds its setting in the dark, and the standing ward answers the same click the muzzles do — draining off the lane gone quiet, banking under the lane taking fire. Cover is allocated the way shot is: never everywhere, always somewhere.",
