      "flavor": "Its trifurcate throats burned through and slumped into a knuckle of clinker, the bores still open, nothing left inside to spit. What is already wholly burnt cannot burn again. Press it to a marching order and the ash rides out with it, laying that same char crust over every deployed thing; break the crust and it stays broken, for ash does not grow back.",
